This is the LegoTypes vendor repository package. Installing it adds the
LegoTypes package repository to the firmware, so its plugins appear under
System > Firmware > Plugins and update with firmware updates. Packages are
signed; the repository's key fingerprint is installed with this package.

The plugins it provides, and what each does, are listed at
https://legotypes.github.io/

Uninstalling this package removes the repository again; plugins already
installed from it stay installed until removed.

